  {
    "id": "id_1774581353973",
    "title": "COSMOS",
    "desc": "This setup features a minimalist, dot-matrix aesthetic typical of Nothing OS, centered around functional information delivery. It includes a Google Search bar at the top, followed by a primary clock and solar tracker square showing the time and sun cycle, a large circular weather icon, and two small circular app shortcuts. Mid-section widgets include a detailed daylight arc, a screen recorder toggle, and a step or activity counter. Finally, a square quote widget provides a rotating piece of text, while the bottom of the screen displays standard circular app icons for phone, messaging, camera, and the Brave browser, all set against a textured, grainy gradient background.",
    "ssLock": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nothingcommunity/Testing/main/2026_feb/1774581340915_lock_ss.jpg",
    "ssHome": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nothingcommunity/Testing/main/2026_feb/1774581342657_home_ss.jpg",
